This product includes software developed as an open-source, cross-platform
agent runtime for smart TVs and living-room devices.

The runtime has no third-party runtime dependencies: an installed bundle
contains no code from any other party. Build-time tools (TypeScript, esbuild,
Vitest, ESLint, typescript-eslint, pnpm, Node.js) are used under their own
permissive licences and are not redistributed here. `pnpm sbom` writes a
CycloneDX inventory of everything installed.

